<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Placer year net profit A$43.5 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Placer year net profit A$43.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    82.54 vs 123.16</p>
<p>    Net				     43.52 vs 58.59</p>
<p>NOTE: Placer Pacific Ltd is an Australian and Papua New Guinea gold miner and is about 77 percent owned by Placer Dome Inc of Canada, which has offered to buy out the remaining shares it does not already own in the Australian group. Placer Pacific annual result was also released informally on February 6 as part of the independent experts report.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  580.00 vs 500.80</p>
<p>    Other income			  14.76 vs 24.72</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    6.90 vs 9.40</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs loss 10.70</p>
<p>    Tax				     34.83 vs 43.00</p>
<p>    Interest				 4.99 vs 1.16</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  87.83 vs 70.16</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
